Z||000000||Rick 88||09-13-2001||05:58 PM||||After the shock of what happened settled in I like many of you lined up to donate blood. All of us would like to do more To show respect for the victims, I'm flying a small American flag at half mast on my antenna. Response from other drivers has been thumbs up, salutes, even "V" for victory. I think it would be nice if more people did this.<P>Rick 88 ||||reg||14
